<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Settings gear (v1.5.0), hand-drawn: an 8-tooth ring (alternating
  radii 10 / 7.5 around the 12,12 centre of a 24x24 viewport) with a
  light centre hole. Two flat paths, no fill-rule and no rotation
  groups, so it renders the same on every API level. The hole is
  filled with the card colour (lt_surface): on the white card it
  reads as a hole, and it stays white when the card is focused
  (light-red fill). Verify visually on device.
-->
